<title>USA: Trustmark Corp to acquire First Corinth.</title>
<headline>Trustmark Corp to acquire First Corinth.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trustmark Corp said on Friday it plans to merge with First Corinth Corp.</p>
<p>The merger will be subject to all applicable corporate, shareholder and regulatory approvals.</p>
<p>First Corinth Corp reported total assets at June 30, 1996, of $135 million and four office locations.</p>
<p>Trustmark reported total assets at June 30, 1996, of $5.1 billion and currently has 162 locations in Mississippi.</p>
<p>Terms of the merger were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
